OL,3,AOil facilities hit in deadly overnight
OL,4,Aattack on St Petersburg
OL,5,
OL,6,FKyiv has not yet commented on the
OL,7,Fstrikes. Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,8,FZelensky said on Saturday morning that
OL,9,FRussia had targeted his country's
OL,10,Fenergy sector 76 times since Donald
OL,11,FTrump declared an "energy ceasefire"
OL,12,Flast week.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/38
