OL,3,AEuropean diplomats attacked by Israeli
OL,4,Asettlers in West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FA delegation of European diplomats has
OL,7,Fbeen attacked by masked Israeli
OL,8,Fsettlers in the occupied West Bank.
OL,10,FBelgium condemned the assault on its
OL,11,Fconsul general and the other envoys,
OL,12,Fwhile France decried the attack as
OL,13,F"appalling". Both called for Israel to
OL,14,Fbring those responsible to justice.
OL,16,FThe Israel Defense Forces (IDF) also
OL,17,Fcondemned what they called "the severe
OL,18,Fact of violence" and said they were
OL,19,Finvestigating.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
